tActionDataSetter::UpdateSelectionCache` clean up and restart selection batch which the editor started. r=smaug, a=RyanVM\n\nWhen `Selection` instance is updated, the old selection may be in batch.\nIn the case, `UpdateSelectionCache` should clean up the batch in the old\nselection and start new one in the new selection instead.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D139349", "files": ["editor/libeditor/EditorBase.cpp", "editor/libeditor/EditorBase.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "36658d4106cfd9f2b36f8aeeaae284c4d981ee5d", "parents": ["fa81f931095e96a9a9cc0502752b8d6b1d7523fc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "R. Martinho Fernandes \u003cbugs@rmf.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1755621 - Check webauthn extensions r=dveditz, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D139499", "files": ["dom/webauthn/WinWebAuthnManager.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1cd088e4f1e8c04627ed954f7cb301e496b92bac", "parents": ["36658d4106cfd9f2b36f8aeeaae284c4d981ee5d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1647286573, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "213": {"changesets": [{"author": "Michelle Goossens \u003cmichelle@masterwayz.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1759705 - Run Windows 10 marionette tests on Azure. r=jmaher, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D141118", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/test/marionette.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5b7d4f33b8d8871c353a9732acacc26d3ea7c507", "parents": ["1cd088e4f1e8c04627ed954f7cb301e496b92bac"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr91 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D140956", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager